=== narrow ===

 start the docs server and a watcher


start docs $ python3 -m http.server … 1L

Both are up.


 🤖 The session was closed and reopened
    after the last turn. Jobs docs and
    watch stopped when it closed.
    Restart each if still needed.



 carry on


list jobs 2L
restart docs 1L

Restarted docs from the command it was
remembered with.
